<title>FRANCE: Eramet - dollar rise may offset nickel price drop.</title>
<headline>Eramet - dollar rise may offset nickel price drop.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>French nickel mining company Eramet said in a statement on Thursday it did not expect major changes in its main markets in the second half of 1997 and that the recent decline in the price of nickel could be partly offset by the rise in the dollar.</p>
<p>&quot;The recent decline in the price of nickel could be offset, at least in part, by the rise in the dollar,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>Eramet said on Thursday it expected 1997 first half net profit to be at least as high as the level in the year earlier period.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452 cla/</p>
</text>
